  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lamb korma serves 4 and takes about 100 minutes. Cook it low and slow for tender meat and a silky gravy. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ghee",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ghee"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and ground almonds give it a rich body."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Add the yoghurt slowly off the heat so the gravy stays smooth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
